[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6781.669, "timestamp": "01:53:01", "text": "南印度。是的。所以，它是北面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6783.75, "timestamp": "01:53:03", "text": "你。这是真的。但对我来说却是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6785.83, "timestamp": "01:53:05", "text": "不是北方。这里更像是印度中部地区。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6789.99, "timestamp": "01:53:09", "text": "我啊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6792.55, "timestamp": "01:53:12", "text": "我的意思是，在地图上它就在附近"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6794.47, "timestamp": "01:53:14", "text": "中央邦，所以应该更多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6798.87, "timestamp": "01:53:18", "text": "中间偏右。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6801.27, "timestamp": "01:53:21", "text": "而且我觉得浦那也是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6805.149, "timestamp": "01:53:25", "text": "好的。你是喀拉拉邦人吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6809.51, "timestamp": "01:53:29", "text": "嗯，也许吧。哦，不，就在附近。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6814.189, "timestamp": "01:53:34", "text": "是的，也许有些人会忘记"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6817.03, "timestamp": "01:53:37", "text": "YouTube上的BTuber们真是太棒了。我忘了他们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6818.79, "timestamp": "01:53:38", "text": "抱歉。不，没关系。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6823.27, "timestamp": "01:53:43", "text": "美好的。我的意思是，呃，就我而言，嗯……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6825.79, "timestamp": "01:53:45", "text": "它在点赞上被揭露了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6829.189, "timestamp": "01:53:49", "text": "嗯，你还记得吗？你还记得吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6832.709, "timestamp": "01:53:52", "text": "那篇关于印度 YouTuber 的文章"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6836.07, "timestamp": "01:53:56", "text": "还有别的什么？嗯，我知道这件事。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6837.99, "timestamp": "01:53:57", "text": "是的，那里好像提到过。"}]